# scripts/crontab
# supercronic format: standard 5-field cron + command.
# Matches T17b's documented "every 1-2 minutes" external-timer target.
#
# --config points at /conf, NOT /secrets: config.py's secret_root() rejects
# a secret_root at or below the config file's own directory for deployed
# profiles, so an app.toml living inside /secrets makes every tick die with
# "deployed secret root must be outside the project directory". /conf is a
# separate read-only bind mount (${APP_CONFIG_DIR} in docker-compose.yml).
# tests/security/test_container_config_loads.py runs this exact argument
# string inside the built image so the two can never drift apart again.
* * * * * python3 /app/scripts/run_daily_entrypoint.py --config /conf/app.toml --database /data/app.db
